  "title": "Fruity Grilled Pork Tenderloin",
  "description": "Plum jam, soy sauce, brown sugar and fruit soda combine to make a splendid marinade for juicy, grilled pork tenderloin. Try serving it sliced over a simple salad of baby lettuces for a sensational summer meal.",
  "authors": [
